<title>USA: TABLE - Hershey Foods Q2 shr profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hershey Foods Q2 shr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>HERSHEY, Pa. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended</p>
<p>			 June 29		   June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.33		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			 50,564		   40,847</p>
<p> Revs		     905,279		  796,343</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 152,779		  152,808</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.78		     0.65</p>
<p> Net			119,458		  100,262</p>
<p> Revs		   1,908,198		1,727,857</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 152,779		  152,808</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Hershey Foods Corp.</p>
<p>The company said Q2 results were driven by strong sales growth stemming from the acquisition of Leaf North American, core brand growth and new products.</p>
